{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>And you remained in Kadesh many days.</b> Nineteen years; and you dwelt there as many days as you dwelt in all the other stations, which were thirty-eight years. And so he mentions below: ״והימים אשר הלכנו מקדש ברנע עד אשר עברנו את נחל זרד שלשים ושמנה שנה״, and so they said in Seder Olam: nineteen years they spent in Kadesh, and nineteen years they went back and were tossed about in the wilderness."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:44:46.059769765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}